# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — never commit. Credentials live in ~/Claude/.env, OUTSIDE this repo,
# and are read at runtime (FRED / Stooq / Telegram). Nothing in this tree
# contains a key, but these patterns are here as a backstop.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
*.env
*secret*
*credentials*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerable artifacts — excluded to keep the repo reviewable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Virtualenv (177 MB) — rebuild with: python3 -m venv venv && venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt
news_impact_pipeline/venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Market database (28 MB) — rebuild from scratch with bootstrap_market_data.py
market_data/*.db
market_data/exports/

# Rendered HTML reports — generated from the .md sources by render_report.py
*.html

# Run logs
news_impact_pipeline/logs/

# Deep-research PDFs — the .md version of every study is committed; the PDF is
# the same content re-exported, and would add ~4 MB of duplicates.
*.pdf

# macOS
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Daily analysis archive.
#
# The system has produced ~86 days of analysis. Each card embeds a short
# summary of the day's news, second-hand from wire reporting (Reuters,
# Bloomberg) — so the full archive is kept local and only a pinned sample is
# published, as a representative illustration of the output.
#
# This also means the daily automation, which writes into daily_analysis/
# every morning, cannot silently add new files to a commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
daily_analysis/*
!daily_analysis/_scorecard/
!daily_analysis/2026-08-17/
!daily_analysis/2026-08-18/
!daily_analysis/2026-08-19/

# Forecast ledger: the raw evidence behind the weekly scorecard — kept.
!daily_analysis/forecast_ledger.csv

# Stray run logs next to the database
market_data/*.log

# Baseline dei conteggi righe per i test di regressione: si rigenera da sola
news_impact_pipeline/tests/.baseline_assets.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Prompt di deep research (2026-09-10): restano SOLO locali, mai committati —
# sono richieste di lavoro in sospeso per il maintainer, non output finito.
# README.md e _TEMPLATE.md (l'infrastruttura della cartella) restano tracciati.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
knowledge_base/_prompts/*
!knowledge_base/_prompts/README.md
!knowledge_base/_prompts/_TEMPLATE.md
